<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Semiconductor Jan-Sept sales up.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Semiconductor Jan-Sept sales up.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Corp said on Tuesday combined sales revenues between January and September totalled T$31.138 billion, up 55.2 percent from a year ago.</p>
<p>Taiwan's largest semiconductor maker said company sales were T$3.104 billion in September, up 11.4 percent from September 1995. It did not give profit figures.</p>
<p>Taiwan Semiconductor has set a 1996 net profit target of T$22.07 billion on sales of T$41.97 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (25080815)</p>
</text>
